          %p
            i.e. the resulting joint morphism on the left makes
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Y
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Y
            and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Z
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z
            conditionally independent given
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
          %p
            Equivalently, a Markov category is positive if and only if for every joint morphism
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi h
                  %mo :
                  %mi A
                  %mo →
                  %mi X
                  %mo ⊗
                  %mi Y
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} h:A\to X\otimes Y
            such that one of its marginals is deterministic,
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi h
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} h
            exhibits conditional independents of its outputs given its input.
          %p
            In a positive Markov category, every isomorphism is deterministic (
            %a{:href => "#fritzmarkov"}> Fritz’20
            , Remark 11.28).
          %p
            A Markov category is called
            %strong causal
            if, whenever the following equation holds,
